nd discussion</span></a><li class=toc-list-entry-outline-padding><a class="anchor u-text-truncate anchor-default" href=#aep-section-id17 data-aa-button="sd:product:journal:article:type=anchor:name=outlinelink" title="4. Conclusions"><span class=anchor-text>4. Conclusions</span></a><li class=toc-list-entry-outline-padding><a class="anchor u-text-truncate anchor-default" href=#aep-acknowledgment-id18 data-aa-button="sd:product:journal:article:type=anchor:name=outlinelink" title=Acknowledgements><span class=anchor-text>Acknowledgements</span></a><li class=toc-list-entry-outline-padding><a class="anchor u-text-truncate anchor-default" href=#aep-bibliography-id19 data-aa-button="sd:product:journal:article:type=anchor:name=outlinelink" title=References><span class=anchor-text>References</span></a></ol><div class=PageDivider></div></div><div class=CitedBy id=toc-cited-by><h2 class=u-h4><a class="anchor anchor-default" href=#section-cited-by><span class=anchor-text>Cited By (29)</span></a></h2><div class=PageDivider></div></div><div class=Figures id=toc-figures><h2 class=u-h4>Figures (6)</h2><ol><li><a class="anchor anchor-default" href=#FIG1 data-aa-button="sd:product:journal:article:type=anchor:name=figure"><span class=anchor-text><div><img alt="Fig. 1. Microstructure of Mg–Nd alloy after T6 temperature" src="data:image/gif;base64," style=max-width:125px;max-height:94px></div></span></a><li><a class="anchor anchor-default" href=#FIG2 data-aa-button="sd:product:journal:article:type=anchor:name=figure"><span class=anchor-text><div><img alt="Fig. 2. Stress–strain curves obtained at various temperatures, initial strain rate 3" src="data:image/gif;base64," style=max-width:125px;max-height:92px></div></span></a><li><a class="anchor anchor-default" href=#FIG3 data-aa-button="sd:product:journal:article:type=anchor:name=figure"><span class=anchor-text><div><img alt="Fig. 3. Temperature dependence of the maximum stress and the yield stress" src=data:image/gif;base64, style=max-width:122px;max-height:93px></div></span></a><li><a class="anchor anchor-default" href=#FIG4 data-aa-button="sd:product:journal:article:type=anchor:name=figure"><span class=anchor-text><div><img alt="Fig. 4. Twins observed after deformation at (a) 100°C and (b) 300°C" src=data:image/gif;base64, style=max-width:64px;max-height:93px></div></span></a><li><a class="anchor anchor-default" href=#FIG5 data-aa-button="sd:product:journal:article:type=anchor:name=figure"><span class=anchor-text><div><img alt="Fig. 5. Stress–strain curves obtained at various strain rates at 250°C" src="data:image/gif;base64," style=max-width:124px;max-height:93px></div></span></a><li><a class="anchor anchor-default" href=#FIG6 data-aa-button="sd:product:journal:article:type=anchor:name=figure"><span class=anchor-text><div><img alt="Fig. 6. Strain rate dependence of the yield stress" src=data:image/gif;base64, style=max-width:124px;max-height:93px></div></span></a></ol><div class=PageDivider></div></div></div></div><article class="col-lg-12 col-md-16 pad-left pad-right" role=main lang=en><div class=Publication id=publication><div class="publication-brand u-show-from-sm"><a class="anchor anchor-default" href=https://www.sciencedirect.com/journal/journal-of-alloys-and-compounds title="Go to Journal of Alloys and Compounds on ScienceDirect"><span class=anchor-text><img class=publication-brand-image src="data:image/png;base64," alt=Elsevier></span></a></div><div class="publication-volume u-text-center"><h2 class="publication-title u-h3" id=publication-title><a class="anchor publication-title-link anchor-navigation" href=https://www.sciencedirect.com/journal/journal-of-alloys-and-compounds title="Go to Journal of Alloys and Compounds on ScienceDirect"><span class=anchor-text>Journal of Alloys and Compounds</span></a></h2><div class=text-xs><a class="anchor anchor-default" href=https://www.sciencedirect.com/journal/journal-of-alloys-and-compounds/vol/378/issue/1 title="Go to table of contents for this volume/issue"><span class=anchor-text>Volume 378, Issues 1–2</span></a>, 22 September 2004, Pages 180-183</div></div><div class="publication-cover u-show-from-sm"><a class="anchor anchor-default" href=https://www.sciencedirect.com/journal/journal-of-alloys-and-compounds/vol/378/issue/1><span class=anchor-text><img class=publication-cover-image src="data:image/gif;base64," alt="Journal of Alloys and Compounds"></span></a></div></div><h1 id=screen-reader-main-title class="Head u-font-gulliver u-h2 u-margin-s-ver"><span class=title-text>Deformation behaviour of Mg–0.7 wt.% Nd alloy</span></h1><div class=Banner id=banner><div class="wrapper truncated"><div class="AuthorGroups text-s"><div class=author-group id=author-group><span class=sr-only>Author links open overlay panel</span><button class="button-link workspace-trigger button-link-primary" name=baep-author-id7 type=button><span class=button-link-text><span class=react-xocs-alternative-link><span class=given-name>V.</span> <span class="text surname">Gärtnerová</span> </span><span class=author-ref id=bAFF1><sup>a</sup></span></span></button>, <button class="button-link workspace-trigger button-link-primary" name=baep-author-id8 type=button><span class=button-link-text><span class=react-xocs-alternative-link><span class=given-name>Z.</span> <span class="text surname">Trojanová</span> </span><span class=author-ref id=bAFF1><sup>a</sup></span><svg role=img focusable=false viewBox="0 0 106 128" width=20 height=20 class="icon icon-person react-xocs-author-icon" aria-label=Person><path d="m11.07 1.2e2l0.84-9.29c1.97-18.79 23.34-22.93 41.09-22.93 17.74 0 39.11 4.13 41.08 22.84l0.84 9.38h10.04l-0.93-10.34c-2.15-20.43-20.14-31.66-51.03-31.66s-48.89 11.22-51.05 31.73l-0.91 10.27h10.03m41.93-102.29c-9.72 0-18.24 8.69-18.24 18.59 0 13.67 7.84 23.98 18.24 23.98s18.24-10.31 18.24-23.98c0-9.9-8.52-18.59-18.24-18.59zm0 52.29c-15.96 0-28-14.48-28-33.67 0-15.36 12.82-28.33 28-28.33s28 12.97 28 28.33c0 19.19-12.04 33.67-28 33.67"></path>